        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jānis Šipkēvics, Andris Sējāns, Juris Lisenko, Jānis Ozols, Jānis Strazdiņš, Reinis Sējāns\n- Organizations: Cosmos\n- Places: Riga, Latvia\n- Products: Pa un par\n- Companies: UPE\n- Concepts: Bass voice, vocal ranges, a cappella\n\nFacts:\n- Cosmos was a Latvian a cappella band that formed in Riga in 2002.\n- Cosmos comprised Jānis Šipkēvics and Andris Sējāns as countertenors, Juris Lisenko as tenor, Jānis Ozols as baritone, Jānis Strazdiņš as bass, and Reinis Sējāns as rhythm.\n- Pa un par was an album by the Latvian a cappella vocal group Cosmos that was released on the UPE record label in 2005.\n- A bass is a type of classical male singing voice with the lowest vocal range among voice types.",
